; Direct lowering of a validated [Fusion_plan.t] to the structured SSA IR, and
; the runner that executes a lowered program over bound tensors. Source adapters
; live here, never in [ssa_ir], which owns no tensor, kernel or graph type.
;
; Depends on [native] (Kernel, Fusion_plan, Tensor) and [ssa_ir], and on neither
; the Loop IR nor any emitter: the Loop comparison bridge is a separate
; library over both. See the SSA design and implementation plan in .ai/.

(library
 (name ssa_lower)
 (libraries core err_trace expr fmt native ssa_ir))
